@startuml

title Golang百万级流水数据综合优化处理流程 - 时序图

actor "用户/API" as User
participant "分析服务 (Analyze Func)" as Service
participant "任务管道 (Jobs Channel)" as JobsCh
participant "Worker Pool (Goroutines)" as Workers
participant "结果管道 (Results Channel)" as ResultsCh
participant "聚合器 (Aggregator)" as Aggregator
database "数据库 (DB)" as DB

autonumber "<b>[00]"

User -> Service: 发起分析请求 (含规则参数)
activate Service

Service -> DB: <b>并发地</b>加载维表 (对手方, 关联方等)
activate DB
DB --> Service: 返回维表数据
deactivate DB
Service -> Service: 将维表存入内存Map

Service -> JobsCh: 创建任务管道
Service -> ResultsCh: 创建结果管道
Service -> Aggregator: <b>[async]</b> 启动聚合器Goroutine
activate Aggregator
Service -> Workers: <b>[async]</b> 启动Worker Pool (N个Goroutines)
activate Workers

Service -> Service: 启动生产者(Producer) Goroutine
Service -> DB: <b>[Streaming]</b> 发起流式查询获取交易流水
activate DB

loop 数据流读取
    DB --> Service: 返回一批(batch)交易数据
    Service -> JobsCh: 发送数据批次到管道
end

DB --> Service: 流水数据读取完毕
deactivate DB
Service -> JobsCh: close(Jobs Channel)
deactivate Service

Workers -> JobsCh: 接收数据批次
loop 对每个批次
    Workers -> Workers: <b>[并发]</b> 执行复杂规则分析\n(利用内存中的维表Map)
    Workers -> ResultsCh: 发送分析结果(可疑交易)
end
deactivate Workers

Aggregator -> ResultsCh: 接收分析结果
loop 结果聚合
    Aggregator -> Aggregator: 暂存结果到内存缓冲区
    alt 缓冲区满 或 超时
        Aggregator -> DB: <b>批量写入</b>可疑交易结果
        activate DB
        DB --> Aggregator: 写入成功
        deactivate DB
        Aggregator -> Aggregator: 清空缓冲区
    end
end
deactivate Aggregator

' 最终完成信号（可以用WaitGroup等机制）
' 此处简化表示
note over Service, Aggregator
    通过 WaitGroup 等待所有Workers和Aggregator完成
end note

@enduml